ing.\n  •  Slightly increases stability\n  •  Greatly increases reload speed"},{"name":"Light Mag","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/736b486ddb80beefacb4f09b5ad016eb.png","desc":"Improved reload and range.\n  •  Increases reload speed\n  •  Slightly increases range"},{"name":"Accurized Rounds","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/d85024478504205359c7fb52dbc4f6b6.png","desc":"This weapon can fire longer distances.\n  •  Increases range"},{"name":"Tactical Mag","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/f0e309a267b25279a871d182f8910bcc.png","desc":"This weapon has multiple tactical improvements.\n  •  Slightly increases stability\n  •  Increases reload speed\n  •  Slightly increases magazine size"},{"name":"Drop Mag","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/9d19f0c349652f0285bb5f999307b8a1.png","desc":"Increases reload speed but reduces magazine size."},{"name":"Steady Rounds","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/6c6e1cc341487a8afd0b0c714a229255.png","desc":"This magazine is optimized for recoil control.\n  •  Greatly increases stability \n  •  Slightly decreases range\n  •  Increases airborne effectiveness"}]},{"label":"Trait","weight":3,"perks":[{"name":"Under Pressure","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/ac8ec81cd8139434a4b19e459bd9b8ff.png","desc":"Improved stability and accuracy as the magazine gets lower."},{"name":"Slideshot","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/7d41765e3db3a77da5cce27888c52d87.png","desc":"Sliding partially reloads this weapon's magazine and temporarily boosts range and stability."},{"name":"Dynamic Sway Reduction","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/36091de4dd029fb6e6ab95dbc612ff05.png","desc":"Improves accuracy and stability while continuously holding down the trigger."},{"name":"Pugilist","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/93bb6bb34fb0616805ba2a7181ab386c.png","desc":"Final blows with this weapon generate melee energy. \nDealing melee damage briefly improves this weapon's handling."},{"name":"Well-Rounded","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/29d63faf15876cf3a9a382aa857b608b.png","desc":"Throwing a grenade or hitting a target with a charged melee grants a stacking bonus to weapon stability, handling, and range.\n\nUsing a Super grants maximum stacks."},{"name":"Compulsive Reloader","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/ef5843dfe8134c7385945216ece2bb06.png","desc":"Grants increased reload speed when close to full magazine."},{"name":"Subsistence","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/eaa8f4295a71bf47df7ffd8599f7af4d.png","desc":"Defeating targets partially reloads the magazine from reserves."},{"name":"Tap the Trigger","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/a7840da2970b4137a333fb187477dfe0.png","desc":"Grants a short period of increased stability and accuracy on initial trigger pull."},{"name":"Triple Tap","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/0795f44c0c3611b15428742c67918cd1.png","desc":"Rapidly landing precision hits will return one round to the magazine."},{"name":"High-Impact Reserves","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/33ed859a08f2ccf643a1ac3c7f201966.png","desc":"Rounds at the end of the magazine deal more damage."},{"name":"Outlaw","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/382df469a091c33e190ee583b64923e8.png","desc":"Precision kills greatly decrease reload time."},{"name":"Pulse Monitor","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/64642b7455e88ffde77be53ce7cb7c05.png","desc":"Automatically reloads the magazine and improves weapon handling when wounded—even when this weapon is stowed."},{"name":"Mulligan","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/8ca9b9caef4c4c5c0c19d3be25be3755.png","desc":"Missing a shot has a chance to return ammo directly to the magazine."},{"name":"Fourth Time's the Charm","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/a5edd4e751e1aa34bf8328a63b121e71.png","desc":"Rapidly landing precision hits will return two rounds to the magazine."},{"name":"Zen Moment","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/9650a58cd3a439bf3b53a53dbc8122a0.png","desc":"Causing damage with this weapon reduces recoil and flinch over time."},{"name":"Lone Wolf","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/4c244b847778a484726543e5c35935ef.png","desc":"Slightly improves aim assist, aim down sights speed, and airborne effectiveness. Increases these effects when there are no nearby allies."},{"name":"Overflow","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/3165fec56b59363fa974a11f5730f4ec.png","desc":"Picking up Special or Heavy ammo automatically loads this weapon beyond normal capacity."},{"name":"Rewind Rounds","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/a201fd61905b802867b677cf927e6e04.png","desc":"When this weapon's magazine is empty, it refills from reserves based on the number of hits."}]},{"label":"Trait","weight":3,"perks":[{"name":"Gutshot Straight","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/5c4c785bde7b9808d48ded283256750e.png","desc":"Aiming down sights increases body shot damage, decreases target acquisition."},{"name":"Vorpal Weapon","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/bc5130b227ee577f2678ec2d2c97bf4a.png","desc":"Increased damage against bosses, vehicles, and Guardians with their Super active."},{"name":"Under-Over","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/22587c092ade23b9ea1a48ba871e8788.png","desc":"Deals bonus damage to targets with overshields. Deals a small amount of bonus damage to combatant shields."},{"name":"Tap the Trigger","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/a7840da2970b4137a333fb187477dfe0.png","desc":"Grants a short period of increased stability and accuracy on initial trigger pull."},{"name":"Kill Clip","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/0afd4799427004b2d8170ab213a2ef0c.png","desc":"Reloading after a kill grants increased damage."},{"name":"Swashbuckler","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/42631a4aff4432e794529a5a707eba61.png","desc":"This weapon gains increased damage from melee kills and kills with this weapon."},{"name":"Osmosis","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/22ca6e872824561b12e91517e1bde608.png","desc":"Using your grenade ability partia